<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Hugoton Energy.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Hugoton Energy.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of investment limited partnerships managed by First Reserve Corp. of Greenwich, Conn., said on Tuesday it cut its stake in Hugoton Energy Corp. to 4,768,411 common shares, or 24.2 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the First Reserve group, which invests in energy companies, said it sold 458,495 Hugoton common shares between July 3 and Jan 14.</p>
</text>
